WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.985
The crowded shell.

00:01.669 --> 00:05.057
Nearly all of them fly low, under two thousand kilometres.

00:05.545 --> 00:13.570
Down here a satellite circles the Earth in about ninety minutes, and junk can cross its path at almost seven times the speed of a bullet.

00:14.180 --> 00:16.377
That is why even small pieces matter.
